>> title: Hermit Bars
>> category: Bars & Brownies
>> tags: molasses, spice, raisins, dessert, oven
>> servings: 12
>> time: 45 min
>> step.6: shape two logs and bake at 350°F for 20 min

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Line a #sheet pan{} with parchment.

Beat @unsalted butter{1/2%cup}(115 g) with @dark brown sugar{1%cup}(200 g), @molasses{1/4%cup}(85 g), and @egg{1%large}(50 g).

Fold @all-purpose flour{1 3/4%cup}(230 g), @ground cinnamon{1%tsp}(2.5 g), @ground ginger{1%tsp}(2 g), @ground cloves{1/4%tsp}(0.5 g), @baking soda{1%tsp}(5 g), @table salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g) into @&(~1)butter mixture{}.

Stir @raisins{1%cup}(150 g), @chopped walnuts{1/2%cup}(55 g) into @&(~1)dough{}.

Bake @&(~1)dough{} as two flat logs on the sheet pan at 350°F for ~{20%min}, then cut across into bars.
